@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 90

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #374151
  ArrowThickness 1
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBD5E1
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

  ParticipantBorderColor #475569
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantFontColor #111827

  ActorBorderColor #475569
  ActorBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ActorFontColor #111827

  BoxBorderColor #CBD5E1
  BoxFontColor #111827
  BoxFontStyle bold

  GroupBorderColor #CBD5E1
  GroupBackgroundColor #F9FAFB
  GroupFontColor #111827
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  FontColor #111827
}

title Executor Runtime Service - Current Delegated Agent Flow
autonumber

box "Executor Runtime Service" #EFF6FF
participant "Dispatch Step\nUse Case" as DispatchStepUseCase
participant "Capability\nResolver" as CapabilityResolver
participant "TechnicalAgentStepExecutor" as TechnicalAgentStepExecutor
participant "AgentReplyWaiter" as AgentReplyWaiter
participant "Technical Agent\nReply Handler" as TechnicalAgentReplyHandler
end box

box "Messaging" #F8FAFC
queue "Technical Agent Request Topic" as TechnicalAgentRequestTopic
queue "Technical Agent Result Topic" as TechnicalAgentResultTopic
end box

box "Execution Targets" #F8FAFC
participant "AsyncAgent\nDelegator" as AsyncAgentDelegator
participant "Technical Agent" as TechnicalAgent
end box

box "External Systems" #F8FAFC
participant "Agent Registry" as AgentRegistry
end box

box "Downstream" #F8FAFC
participant "Dispatch Step\nResult" as DispatchStepResult
end box

group Dispatch delegated agent step
note over DispatchStepUseCase #FEF3C7
WARNING:
Entry point for this diagram:
a validated agent.<uuid> step has already reached DispatchStepUseCase.
Validation and status publishing are documented in
executor_runtime_current_shared_flow.puml
end note

DispatchStepUseCase -> CapabilityResolver: resolve(step.execute_by)
CapabilityResolver -> AgentRegistry: Lookup agent metadata + queue metadata
AgentRegistry --> CapabilityResolver: ResolvedCapability(TECHNICAL_AGENT) or None

alt Registry lookup failed
CapabilityResolver --> DispatchStepUseCase: None
DispatchStepUseCase --> DispatchStepResult: StepResult(error: capability not found)
else Capability disabled
CapabilityResolver --> DispatchStepUseCase: ResolvedCapability(enabled=false)
DispatchStepUseCase --> DispatchStepResult: StepResult(error: capability disabled)
else TECHNICAL_AGENT capability resolved
CapabilityResolver --> DispatchStepUseCase: ResolvedCapability(TECHNICAL_AGENT)
DispatchStepUseCase -> TechnicalAgentStepExecutor: execute(request, capability)
note over TechnicalAgentStepExecutor #FEF3C7
WARNING:
TechnicalAgentStepExecutor builds AgentCallRequest, generates a delegated
correlation_id, and captures executor context metadata.
end note
TechnicalAgentStepExecutor -> AgentReplyWaiter: register(delegated correlation_id)

alt Delegation fails before wait
TechnicalAgentStepExecutor -> AsyncAgentDelegator: delegate(agent_call)
AsyncAgentDelegator --> TechnicalAgentStepExecutor: Exception
TechnicalAgentStepExecutor --> DispatchStepUseCase: StepResult(error)
DispatchStepUseCase --> DispatchStepResult: StepResult(error)
note over TechnicalAgentStepExecutor,AsyncAgentDelegator #FEE2E2
ERROR:
Delegation failed before a terminal reply could be awaited.
end note
else Delegation published
TechnicalAgentStepExecutor -> AsyncAgentDelegator: delegate(agent_call)
AsyncAgentDelegator -> TechnicalAgentRequestTopic: Publish executor.request.agent
TechnicalAgentRequestTopic -> TechnicalAgent: Deliver delegated request
TechnicalAgent -> TechnicalAgentResultTopic: Publish agent.step.status
TechnicalAgentResultTopic -> TechnicalAgentReplyHandler: Deliver reply

alt Non-terminal reply
TechnicalAgentReplyHandler --> AgentReplyWaiter: Ignore processing/running/in_progress/interrupted
note over TechnicalAgentReplyHandler #FEF3C7
WARNING:
Non-terminal delegated replies are ignored and do not resolve the waiter.
end note
else Unknown correlation_id
TechnicalAgentReplyHandler --> AgentReplyWaiter: resolve(...) = false
note over TechnicalAgentReplyHandler #FEE2E2
ERROR:
Replies for unknown correlation IDs are logged and ignored.
end note
else Terminal reply with known correlation_id
TechnicalAgentReplyHandler -> AgentReplyWaiter: resolve(correlation_id, payload)
alt Reply normalization yields success
AgentReplyWaiter --> TechnicalAgentStepExecutor: reply payload
TechnicalAgentStepExecutor --> DispatchStepUseCase: StepResult(success, output)
DispatchStepUseCase --> DispatchStepResult: StepResult(success)
note over AsyncAgentDelegator,TechnicalAgent #DCFCE7
SUCCESS:
Delegated agent call completed and produced a correlated result.
end note
else Reply normalization yields error
AgentReplyWaiter --> TechnicalAgentStepExecutor: reply payload
TechnicalAgentStepExecutor --> DispatchStepUseCase: StepResult(error)
DispatchStepUseCase --> DispatchStepResult: StepResult(error)
end
else Reply timeout
AgentReplyWaiter --> TechnicalAgentStepExecutor: TimeoutError
TechnicalAgentStepExecutor --> DispatchStepUseCase: StepResult(error)
DispatchStepUseCase --> DispatchStepResult: StepResult(error)
note over AgentReplyWaiter,TechnicalAgentStepExecutor #FEE2E2
ERROR:
No terminal delegated reply arrived before timeout.
end note
end
end
end
end

legend right
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  |<#DCFCE7>| Success / implemented happy path |
  |<#FEF3C7>| TODO / warning / unclear |
  |<#FEE2E2>| Error / failure path |
  |<#EFF6FF>| Executor Runtime Service boundary |
  |<#F8FAFC>| External systems / queues / DB |
endlegend

@enduml
